Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty-Seventh Episode\NThe Battle of Vengeance
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.10,0:02:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's the dove!\N- It has the letter from Prince Franz
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.58,0:02:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,that you've been waiting for so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.70,0:02:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You did a good job,\Nlittle dove.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.06,0:02:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It does a good job every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.38,0:02:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You and Franz love each other so much\Nthat you exchange letters every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.06,0:02:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.22,0:02:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've noticed that you love each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.06,0:02:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.10,0:02:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,"My dear Sapphire,\NI can't wait to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.82,0:02:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,To me you are the moon,\Nthe sun and the stars!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.58,0:02:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a good trip, little dove!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.02,0:03:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he comes up! I recognize\NPrince Franz's footsteps.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.06,0:03:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time he is to receive a\Nletter from his Princess...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.74,0:03:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,...he is so impatient!\N- Haven't you received a reply?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.82,0:03:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You must wait, Prince,\Nbut it will arrive soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.74,0:03:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How about playing a little\Nwhile we wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.66,0:03:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.02,0:03:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll start!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.78,0:03:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3, 4 and 5!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.42,0:03:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do 6!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.74,0:03:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, you won!\NBut if I were ten years younger...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.14,0:03:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about your age,\Nplease! You aren't old at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.02,0:03:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're back, little one! The\NPrince was waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.82,0:03:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you read\Nthat letter, Prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.50,0:03:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so important to me that I\Ndon't feel like opening it right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.66,0:03:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He is totally captivated\Nby the Princess's charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.78,0:04:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a message from\Nthe Northern fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.26,0:04:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.58,0:04:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.78,0:04:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- What is it?\N- Read!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.26,0:04:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What? A fleet is threatening us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.74,0:04:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.46,0:04:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They have no identifying marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.98,0:04:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, they're raising a flag!\NBut it's the flag of Union X!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.90,0:04:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.74,0:04:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,To Prince Franz\Nof the kingdom of Goldland.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.06,0:04:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Our fleet\Nand our army,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.06,0:04:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,strong with a million soldiers,\Nare advancing South.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.30,0:04:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We have defeated all those who\Nopposed our advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.50,0:04:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Abandon all useless resistance\Nand surrender to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.54,0:04:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do not answer us tonight,\Nbefore the moon sets,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.78,0:04:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,we will attack you and destroy you.\NYou have been warned".
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.70,0:04:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Union X, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.02,0:05:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, there will be\Nonce again another war.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.02,0:05:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This time it threatens to be\Na very hard war.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.34,0:05:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I would no longer have to use\Nthe armor, but I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.26,0:05:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does Union X want to attack\Npeaceful Goldland again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.46,0:05:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the flag\Nof the kingdom of Carbonella.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.74,0:05:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What could they want from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.66,0:05:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying? The Sovereign of Carbonella\Nis offering us reinforcements?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.26,0:05:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Sire! We will not leave in danger\Na country bordering us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.66,0:05:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We will fight with 50,000 men.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.86,0:05:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 50,000 men?!\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.94,0:05:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now they are massed at the border.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.06,0:05:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you allow it, they will be deployed\Nto defend the river banks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.54,0:05:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming to our aid\Nis a kind act.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.06,0:06:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure the Ambassadors\Nrest peacefully tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.82,0:06:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Squadron, halt! We will stop here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.14,0:06:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldiers,\NI ask for your attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.78,0:06:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon the moon will set\Nbehind the mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.58,0:06:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,then the Union X army\Nwill advance from that bay from the North.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.74,0:06:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But the King of Carbonella\Nhas committed himself...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.94,0:06:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,..to check the East side\Nof our borders.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.22,0:06:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We must defend\Nour fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.66,0:06:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We must defend it from all\Nthe enemies that will attack it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.38,0:06:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.42,0:07:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Archers, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.26,0:07:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurrah! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.70,0:07:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We must reach Goldland\NCastle as soon as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.26,0:07:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,At a gallop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.30,0:07:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, the battle has begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.78,0:07:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get to work and be\Ncareful not to be noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.30,0:07:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.02,0:07:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Squadron, charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.58,0:08:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy is entering the\Ncastle from the East side!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.18,0:08:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible, it is guarded\Nby Carbonella's army!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.22,0:08:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,At the eastern border, there is no one!\NCarbonella's army...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.30,0:08:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,...has moved against us!\N- It's a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.10,0:08:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And I fell for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.10,0:08:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Little doves,\Nit's dangerous to stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.74,0:08:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Fly away!\NGo away to Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.26,0:08:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What a traitor that Ambassador is!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.90,0:08:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I can't waste time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.22,0:08:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.34,0:08:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor pigeons..!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.42,0:08:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.54,0:09:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens! Could something have happened\Nin the kingdom of Goldland?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.22,0:09:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldier,\Ndo you know where Prince Franz is?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.58,0:09:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He is in the Northern fortress,\Nknight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.78,0:09:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.02,0:09:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- Carbonella's flag!\N- Halt! What do you want? Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.90,0:09:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Stay right where you are!\N- Help me, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.94,0:09:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Run! Chase that wretch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.46,0:09:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get away! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.38,0:09:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.02,0:10:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- But what was that?\N- It felt like a gust of wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.90,0:10:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But these are Goldland soldiers!\NLet's see if they are still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.22,0:10:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness,\Nthis one has regained consciousness!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.10,0:10:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Take this!\N- No! What are you doing? Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.90,0:10:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that no one\Ncould resist me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.06,0:10:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,except for Prince Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.06,0:10:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,As a soldier of the kingdom of\NCarbonella, you are quite good!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.62,0:10:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I find a worthy rival in you.\NWhat is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.54,0:10:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The people of Silverland call me\N"the mysterious knight."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.90,0:10:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The people of Silverland?!\NBut then you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.22,0:10:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly, I am on your side!\NI came here to help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.82,0:10:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, I am terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.18,0:10:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I believed that you were an enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.38,0:11:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I am glad that you\Nrealized the mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.82,0:11:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we must try to\Nbring our help to Goldland.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.38,0:11:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize to you once\Nagain, mysterious knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.38,0:11:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I was going to the Northern\Nfortress, but I was attacked...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.62,0:11:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,...and overwhelmed by a mob of\Nenemies and I lost consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.62,0:11:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I am ashamed of myself,\Nbut now I am ready to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.62,0:11:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I am very\Nworried about Prince Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.42,0:11:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say? Are you\Nalso looking for Prince Franz?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.06,0:11:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the task of receiving\Nand delivering to my Prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.94,0:11:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...the letters that Princess Sapphire\Nsends him from your kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.06,0:11:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So you were taking care\Nof the pigeons?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.26,0:11:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, it was me!\NThose little creatures were wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.42,0:11:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz!\NNow the kingdom of Goldland...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.18,0:11:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,...is in the hands of Union X\Nand in mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.54,0:11:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why do you still not surrender?\N- You wretch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.86,0:11:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,King of Carbonella, here is my\Nanswer to your treachery!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.02,0:12:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Storm the castle!\NWipe out those dogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.94,0:12:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens, perhaps it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.02,0:13:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz! Prince Franz! Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.38,0:13:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, where are you? Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.50,0:13:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I recognize this!\NIt's his hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.66,0:14:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you know where Prince Franz is?\N- No, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.26,0:14:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you happen to have any news\Nof Prince Franz?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.70,0:14:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no news.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.14,0:14:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, where could you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.30,0:14:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Come inside, Prince.\NThe evening dampness...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.74,0:14:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,...is not good for your wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.54,0:14:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but I would like to leave here.\NUnfortunately, I cannot walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.50,0:14:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I don't even have\Na horse anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.86,0:14:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,As if that weren't enough,\NGoldland Castle is on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.62,0:14:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.70,0:15:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, let me tend to your wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.74,0:15:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, moon, let Franz be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.26,0:15:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, write a letter\Nto Princess Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.74,0:15:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What? And how do I send it to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.62,0:15:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I will take it to her, instead of a dove.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.62,0:15:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- But how?\N- Trust me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.66,0:15:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps she is worried about\Nyou! Take off your cloak, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.78,0:15:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- My cloak?!\N- Yes, your cloak!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.06,0:15:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Write on it with this piece of charcoal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.62,0:15:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's the only way to write.\N- It's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.26,0:15:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of your soldiers might\Nhave found refuge in Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.94,0:15:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We must inform them\Nthat you are still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.26,0:16:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of it.\NI'll be back tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.18,0:16:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! Isn't that\Nthe Prince of Goldland?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.06,0:16:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's him. There is a big bounty\Non his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.98,0:16:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's take that bounty ourselves!\N- Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.54,0:16:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,but we must think about\Nthe other one first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.82,0:16:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move! Let's follow him and try\Nto surprise him from behind,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.50,0:16:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,so it will be easier\Nto get rid of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.22,0:16:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell could he have gone?\NI don't see him anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.26,0:16:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.30,0:16:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so big! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.74,0:16:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for you,\Nbut I can't let you escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.46,0:16:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.42,0:16:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- Stop him!\N- Don't let him escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.74,0:17:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.62,0:17:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.02,0:17:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop him!\NHit him with arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.66,0:17:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.62,0:17:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'll help you!\N- Mysterious knight, save yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.54,0:17:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- The mysterious knight?!\N- I will take you with me to Silverland,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.46,0:17:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can keep up the gallop!\NFollow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.34,0:17:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse it, they've entered\Nthe kingdom of Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.94,0:17:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.82,0:17:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Take heart, we're almost\Nthere! Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.66,0:17:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly, open the door!\NIt's Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.74,0:17:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a wounded man!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.02,0:17:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Prince Frank is alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.50,0:18:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?!\N- Yes, he is hidden now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.54,0:18:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,..\N..
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.26,0:18:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.58,0:18:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,in the Shinewood cave, and he is wounded. Then\Nlet's go down there right away to get him. Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.26,0:18:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mysterious knight, please\Ngive this to Princess Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.22,0:18:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But... isn't this\NPrince Franz's cloak?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.94,0:18:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, it contains a message\Nintended for the Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.06,0:18:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you shouldn't read a letter\Naddressed to someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.34,0:18:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's true, sorry!\N- Anyway, I am grateful to you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.46,0:18:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,...for taking care of me.\NMy only regret...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.34,0:18:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- What do you regret?\N- You know, mysterious knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.54,0:18:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I really wanted to deliver\Nthe letter to the Princess myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.62,0:18:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my only regret!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.54,0:18:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How I wish I could meet her\Nbefore I die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.26,0:18:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Old Dodd!\NGood old Dodd!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.06,0:18:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- And who are you?\N- I am Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.18,0:19:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I thank you for all the letters\Nyou sent me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.94,0:19:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,...via your dear doves!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.90,0:19:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess,\Nyou are so beautiful and kind!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.02,0:19:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought!\NI am happy to have met you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.02,0:19:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I have done my duty.\NOne last request, Princess:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.34,0:19:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I entrust Prince Franz to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.86,0:19:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, form an alliance\Nbetween your kingdom and Goldland!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.94,0:19:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Together you can defeat\Nthe enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.74,0:19:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, old Dodd, I will
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.54,0:19:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I am happy about it. I have nothing more\Nto worry about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.78,0:19:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can finally die in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.26,0:19:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Old Dodd!\NOld Dodd, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.18,0:19:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My brave men, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.02,0:19:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear Sapphire, Goldland is now\Noccupied by enemy troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.66,0:19:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I am wounded in the leg\Nand I cannot walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.46,0:20:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not be able to see you again, but I am\Nso happy to have met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.90,0:20:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I am ready\Nto fight strenuously.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.06,0:20:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I am always\Nthe Prince of Goldland.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.02,0:20:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If my body remains\Nlifeless on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.58,0:20:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,my heart will be with you\Nforever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.30,0:20:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish you to be happy\Nfrom the depths of my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.02,0:20:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz\Nto Princess Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.46,0:20:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.30,0:20:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.30,0:20:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who is there?\N- Hello, Prince Franz! How is it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.14,0:21:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Now that I see you, it’s going better!\N- Go, Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.74,0:21:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, mysterious knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.90,0:21:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy is annihilated!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.90,0:21:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like\Nanother group of enemies is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.34,0:21:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make a strategic retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.70,0:21:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course! We will beat them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.34,0:21:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire is waiting for you\Nat that farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.06,0:21:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go and inform her first.\NThis is yours, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.38,0:21:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But how could he have gotten my hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.54,0:22:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Old Dodd, we will reconquer Goldland for you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.78,0:22:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Old Dodd, I too will act according to your last wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.34,0:22:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, what were\Nhis last words?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.46,0:22:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,"Goldland and Silverland should\Nally and destroy the enemy."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.10,0:22:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I entrust Prince Frank to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.82,0:22:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish both of you\Neternal happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.06,0:22:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I will watch over you, dear friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.14,0:22:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Frank, he also said\Nthat he wished...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.46,0:22:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...that you would recover\Nand be happy in your kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.06,0:22:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,finally without any more enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.62,0:22:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sapphire! I will try\Nto take care of myself as he wanted...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.02,0:22:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,...and I will bring his body\Nto the castle of Goldland.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.42,0:22:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I will stifle the outbreaks of war\Nand bring peace back to Goldland.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.34,0:23:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You will help me, won't you, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.46,0:23:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We will join forces to defeat our\Nenemies and we will be so strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.78,0:23:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,...that no one will\Ndare attack us anymore!
